From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Modrinth Enhanced <patches@modrinth-enhanced.invalid>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:11:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Translate Modrinth Enhanced's own text

Everything this fork adds - offline, Ely.by and custom server accounts,
the skin browser, the crash explanations, the sidebar settings - only
ever spoke English, because its strings are not in Modrinth's
catalogues. They are now in every language upstream has the app
translated to at least 70 percent in, which is what the app picks on a
first start as well.
